# Keep the build context small and free of secrets / host artefacts.
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log

# Prisma client is regenerated inside the image.
packages/db/src/generated

# Secrets and local state — never sent to the daemon. Patterns match at ANY depth:
# Next.js standalone output copies apps/web/.env* into the runtime image (security MEDIUM-2).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.local
**/backups
**/*.dump
**/*.dump.sha256

# Not needed to build images.
docs
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
README.md
CLAUDE.md
